# Cortex Cloud Issues Exporter v1.2 Stable

This build continues using `config.json`.

- Standard API Key authentication
- API-side category and severity filters
- Local exclusion of `Resolved` and `Closed`
- Issue name as the first summary column
- Summary and full output modes
- FILTER_COUNT-aware pagination

## Setup

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp config.example.json config.json
nano config.json
```

## Run

```bash
python get_issues.py --config config.json --debug
```
